      "!Sample_data_processing = Aligned reads were deduplicated using Picard.",
      "!Sample_data_processing = Peakswere called using MACS2 from the paired endbed file (bedpe) using a false discovery thresh-old of 0.05 (-q 0.05).",
      "!Sample_data_processing = Normalized bigwig files were created by normalizing the coverage track of the bedpe file by reads in peaks.",
